    '|a||Even if in Russian: даже если, всё-таки, что бы ни':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Say even if, still and whatever happens in Russian: да́же е́сли, всё-таки, хоть и, что бы ни, with из-за, благодаря́ and вме́сто, in Suzdal at minus twenty.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 17640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1pl6gxs'
    '|a||Even if, still, whatever happens: how Russian says the cold won''t stop you. Янва́рь. Мы в Су́здале.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ива́н, брат Ма́ши, посове́товал нам э́то путеше́ствие. Но на у́лице моро́з.':
