    '|a||А Ма́ша: Да́же е́сли бу́дет ещё холодне́е, я не уйду́!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:womppe'
    '|a||Да́же е́сли: even if. Usually about what may still happen, so often a future: бу́дет.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1s7qzwm'
    '|a||Хотя́ хо́лодно: it is cold, now.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ywx53r'
    '|a||Да́же е́сли бу́дет холодне́е: it may get colder. Either way: я не уйду́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1pkad2k'
    '|a||А тепе́рь: что бы ни случи́лось, я не уйду́: whatever happens.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:17y7cej'
    '|a||Случи́ться: to happen. Что случи́лось? What happened?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1vs7iui'
    '|a||Что бы ни, then a past form: случи́лось. As with е́сли бы, the past here isn''t about the past.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:mhfsq7'
    '|a||So too где бы ни, wherever, and как бы ни, however: как бы ни бы́ло хо́лодно, мы гуля́ем.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1foagzn'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы, with хотя́, несмотря́ на and зато́ from lesson 119. Запо́лните про́пуски.':
